ed7950\">3</font>回合。对其他友军释放时，驱散自身所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"后备隐藏脂肪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">后备隐藏脂肪</font></span></span>]并转移给目标。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-3 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a5/s6r3gfw9b043p2s3rgg151zl3c7t66v.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-3_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a5/s6r3gfw9b043p2s3rgg151zl3c7t66v.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B5%81%E6%98%9F%E9%98%9F\" title=\"角色图鉴库/流星队\"><img alt=\"头像 流星队.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/36/fyegbun96i4fodf5glhu8cus4z2ug7t.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">流星队</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: fl